{"path":"io/basic_ostream/swap","title":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/swap","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Calls basic_ios::swap(rhs) to swap all data members of the base class, except for rdbuf(), between *this and rhs.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_ostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ios<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> to swap all data members of the base class, except for <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>. This swap function is protected: it is called by the swap functions of the swappable output stream classes <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\">std::basic_ofstream</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\">std::basic_ostringstream</a></span>, which know how to correctly swap the associated streambuffers.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a basic_ostream of the same type to swap with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> s1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> s2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"bye\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    s1.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK, ostringstream has a public swap()</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\"><span class=\"kw1611\">std::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s1, s2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK, calls s1.swap(s2)</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">//  std::cout.swap(s2); // ERROR: swap is a protected member</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s1.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>hello</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Calls basic_ios::swap(rhs) to swap all data members of the base class, except for rdbuf(), between *this and rhs."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":112,"codeBlockCount":2}
